      "title": "MosaicDiff",
      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "## MosaicDiff\n\n1. **MosaicDiff Prepare** finds the mosaic and restores it with BasicVSR++. The square stays on the mosaic.\n2. **MosaicDiff Reference** encodes that full square in short pieces and pins the border. **SamplerCustomAdvanced** repaints it. Context windows handle the length.\n3. **MosaicDiff Place** decodes the result in pieces and pastes it back into the full video.\n\nRestart ComfyUI after updating the nodes, then reload this workflow."
      ],
      "color": "#222",
      "bgcolor": "#000"
    },
